    "# DarkNav - Model Architecture and Training\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Miriam Garcia Sollo  \n",
    "**Date:** June 2026\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook covers Days 4 and 5:\n",
    "\n",
    "**Day 4 - Model implementation and verification**\n",
    "1. Inspect the U-Net architecture\n",
    "2. Verify tensor dimensions at every stage\n",
    "3. Count parameters and estimate RAM for on-orbit deployment\n",
    "4. Visualise encoder feature maps on a real DEM patch\n",
    "\n",
    "**Day 5 - Training**\n",
    "5. Train Condition A: scratch baseline on real data\n",
    "6. Train Condition B: ImageNet pretrained encoder, fine-tuned on real data\n",
    "7. Train Condition C phase 1: NFW pretraining on synthetic data\n",
    "8. Train Condition C phase 2: fine-tune on real data\n",
    "9. Plot all training curves together"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
